e hardware <span class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></div></nav>\n<main id=\"main\"><section class=\"section product-page-hero tone-yellow\" aria-labelledby=\"product-page-title\"><div class=\"section-head\"><a class=\"meta\" href=\"/hardware\">← All hardware</a><span class=\"meta\">Private AI. Local compute.</span></div><div class=\"product-page-intro\"><p class=\"lead\">Your models.<br>Your machine.</p><p>A compact home for private AI. Built for your models, your projects and the new possibilities of KilnOS.</p></div><div class=\"product-page-stage\"><h1 id=\"product-page-title\">One.</h1><img src=\"/assets/one-interior-yellow-cutout.webp\" width=\"1254\" height=\"1254\" alt=\"Kiln One hardware concept\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></div><div class=\"product-page-bottom\"><div><p class=\"product-price\">£17,000</p><p class=\"meta\">Target hardware price</p></div><button class=\"action primary register-open\" data-interest=\"Kiln One\">Register interest <span class=\"square\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></button></div></section><section class=\"section\" id=\"kilnos\" aria-labelledby=\"kilnos-title\"><div class=\"section-head\"><span class=\"meta\">KilnOS</span><span class=\"meta\">An AI-native operating system.</span></div><div class=\"section-intro\"><h2 id=\"kilnos-title\">Built around<br>the agent.</h2><p>We’re rethinking the operating system around what you want to do. KilnOS brings files, applications and workflows into one connected environment.</p></div><div class=\"local-grid\"><article><span class=\"meta\">01 / Files</span><h3>Everything<br>in context.</h3><p>Find files by what they mean. Keep references, versions and decisions connected to the work.</p></article><article><span class=\"meta\">02 / Applications</span><h3>Tools working<br>together.</h3><p>Let your agent coordinate connected applications, carrying context and permissions from one tool to the next.</p></article><article><span class=\"meta\">03 / Workflows</span><h3>From intent<br>to 